WEBVTT

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.297
Everywhere you look,
there's something to see.

00:02:02.697 --> 00:02:05.597
There is Tom Otterness underground

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:07.697
and Lawrence Weiner underfoot.

00:02:08.497 --> 00:02:10.897
There are so many of us.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.563
Everyone wants to be someone.

00:02:13.597 --> 00:02:15.563
Everyone seeks to be heard.

00:02:15.597 --> 00:02:17.397
Everyone has an opinion,

00:02:17.397 --> 00:02:18.997
A point of view.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.163
And seemingly something to sell.

00:02:22.463 --> 00:02:26.097
But life is different now
as we shelter at home.

00:02:26.397 --> 00:02:27.930
Under the same sky,

00:02:27.963 --> 00:02:30.630
at the same moment, at the same time.